(1) Base Rate for Auto Loan Lease equals sum of Comprehensive and Collision coverage premium for each vehicle.
(2) Factor applied is 1.00 unless Vehicle Type is Motorhome.
(3) TOTAL POLICY PREMIUM is calculated without using the Cap Factor or Minimum Premium to determine whether mitigation applies. If mitigation applies, the algorithm is recalculated using the Cap Factor.
(4) NOA Vehicles are not assigned a Vehicle Type, Model Year, Vehicle Age, Vehicle Usage, Mileage, or Vehicle Symbols and will be rated with a 1.0 factor.
